489	41	Parallel Structure với Correlative Conjunctions	\n\n# Parallel Structure với Correlative Conjunctions\n\n## 1. Khái niệm\n\nCorrelative Conjunctions là các cặp liên từ đi cùng nhau.\n\nCác cặp phổ biến:\n\n- both ... and\n- either ... or\n- neither ... nor\n- not only ... but also\n- whether ... or\n\n## 2. BOTH ... AND\n\nCấu trúc:\n\n**both + A + and + A**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe job requires **both accuracy and speed**.\n\n→ noun + noun\n\n## 3. EITHER ... OR\n\nVí dụ:\n\nYou can **either call us or send an email**.\n\n→ verb + verb\n\n## 4. NEITHER ... NOR\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe employee is **neither experienced nor qualified**.\n\n→ adjective + adjective\n\n## 5. NOT ONLY ... BUT ALSO\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe program is **not only useful but also affordable**.\n\n→ adjective + adjective\n\n## 6. Mẹo TOEIC\n\nSau khi gặp:\n\n**both / either / neither / not only**\n\nhãy tìm phần còn lại:\n\n- and\n- or\n- nor\n- but also\n\nSau đó kiểm tra hai thành phần có song song hay không.\n\n	4	2026-08-08 20:16:10.393981	2026-08-08 20:16:10.393981	\N
