523	44	All, Both, Either và Neither với OF	\n\n# All, Both, Either và Neither với OF\n\n## 1. ALL OF\n\nCấu trúc:\n\n**all of + noun/pronoun**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nAll of the employees attended the meeting.\n\nAll of the information was useful.\n\n## 2. BOTH OF\n\nCấu trúc:\n\n**both of + plural noun/pronoun**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nBoth of the employees are qualified.\n\nBoth of them are available.\n\n## 3. EITHER OF\n\nCấu trúc:\n\n**either of + plural noun/pronoun**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nEither of the options is acceptable.\n\nEither of them is suitable.\n\n## 4. NEITHER OF\n\nCấu trúc:\n\n**neither of + plural noun/pronoun**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nNeither of the options is suitable.\n\nNeither of them is available.\n\n## 5. Đại từ sau OF\n\nCó thể dùng:\n\n- us\n- you\n- them\n\nVí dụ:\n\nboth of them\n\neither of them\n\nneither of them\n\nall of us\n\n## 6. Mẹo TOEIC\n\nĐừng nhầm:\n\nboth employees\n\nvới:\n\nboth of the employees\n\nCả hai đều đúng nhưng cấu trúc khác nhau.\n\n	8	2026-08-08 20:17:30.456787	2026-08-08 20:17:30.456787	\N
