575	49	Get Passive và Have/Get Something Done	\n\n# Get Passive và Have/Get Something Done\n\n## 1. Get Passive\n\nNgoài **be**, đôi khi có thể dùng:\n\n**get + V3**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe equipment got damaged during transportation.\n\nHe got promoted last year.\n\n## 2. Have Something Done\n\nCấu trúc:\n\n**have + object + V3**\n\nThường mang nghĩa thuê hoặc yêu cầu người khác thực hiện hành động.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager had the computer repaired.\n\nShe had her documents printed.\n\n## 3. Get Something Done\n\nCấu trúc:\n\n**get + object + V3**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nWe need to get the equipment repaired.\n\nThe company got the office renovated.\n\n## 4. So sánh\n\nI repaired the computer.\n\n→ Tôi tự sửa máy tính.\n\nI had the computer repaired.\n\n→ Tôi nhờ/yêu cầu người khác sửa máy tính.\n\n## 5. Mẹo TOEIC\n\nNếu chủ thể **không trực tiếp thực hiện hành động** mà nhờ người khác:\n\n**have/get + object + V3**\n\n	9	2026-08-08 20:21:12.361922	2026-08-08 20:21:12.361922	\N
576	49	Bẫy Advanced Passive trong TOEIC	\n\n# Bẫy Advanced Passive trong TOEIC\n\n## 1. Modal Passive\n\nThe documents must ______ before the meeting.\n\nA. review\nB. reviewing\nC. be reviewed\nD. reviewed\n\nĐáp án: **C. be reviewed**\n\n→ modal + be + V3.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Present Perfect Passive\n\nThe report has ______ to all department managers.\n\nA. send\nB. sent\nC. been sent\nD. being sent\n\nĐáp án: **C. been sent**\n\n→ has + been + V3.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Continuous Passive\n\nThe equipment is currently ______.\n\nA. inspect\nB. inspected\nC. being inspected\nD. been inspected\n\nĐáp án: **C. being inspected**\n\n→ is being + V3.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Passive Infinitive\n\nThe application needs ______ by Friday.\n\nA. complete\nB. completing\nC. to complete\nD. to be completed\n\nĐáp án: **D. to be completed**\n\n→ need + to be + V3.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Reporting Verb\n\nThe company is believed ______ its production capacity.\n\nA. increase\nB. increasing\nC. to increase\nD. increased\n\nĐáp án: **C. to increase**\n\n→ be believed to + V.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Reporting Verb với hành động trước\n\nThe manager is believed ______ the company last month.\n\nA. leave\nB. to leave\nC. to have left\nD. leaving\n\nĐáp án: **C. to have left**\n\n→ be believed to have + V3.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Two Objects\n\nThe employee ______ a bonus by the company.\n\nA. gave\nB. was given\nC. was giving\nD. has giving\n\nĐáp án: **B. was given**\n\n→ employee là người nhận.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Causative Passive\n\nThe manager had the report ______.\n\nA. prepare\nB. preparing\nC. prepared\nD. to prepare\n\nĐáp án: **C. prepared**\n\n→ have + object + V3.\n\n---\n\n## 9. Tổng hợp công thức\n\n### Modal Passive\n\nmodal + be + V3\n\n### Perfect Passive\n\nhave/has/had + been + V3\n\n### Continuous Passive\n\nbe + being + V3\n\n### Passive Infinitive\n\nto be + V3\n\n### Passive Gerund\n\nbeing + V3\n\n### Perfect Passive Infinitive\n\nto have been + V3\n\n### Reporting Passive\n\nIt is believed that...\n\nSubject is believed to...\n\n### Causative Passive\n\nhave/get + object + V3\n\n## 10. Mẹo TOEIC\n\nKhi gặp câu bị động nâng cao, đừng chỉ nhìn **V3**.\n\nHãy nhìn toàn bộ chuỗi:\n\n**modal + be + V3**\n\n**has/have + been + V3**\n\n**is/are + being + V3**\n\n**to be + V3**\n\n**to have been + V3**\n\n**have/get + object + V3**\n\n	10	2026-08-08 20:21:12.361922	2026-08-08 20:21:12.361922	\N
577	50	Reporting Verbs là gì?	\n\n# Reporting Verbs là gì?\n\n## 1. Khái niệm\n\nReporting Verbs là các động từ được sử dụng để **tường thuật, báo cáo, thông báo, cho biết, khẳng định hoặc nhận xét** về một thông tin.\n\nCác reporting verbs thường gặp trong TOEIC:\n\n- say\n- tell\n- report\n- announce\n- state\n- explain\n- mention\n- indicate\n- confirm\n- claim\n- suggest\n- recommend\n- advise\n- warn\n- remind\n- inform\n\n## 2. Ví dụ\n\nThe manager **said** that the meeting was canceled.\n\nThe company **announced** that it would open a new branch.\n\nThe report **indicates** that sales have increased.\n\n## 3. Vì sao quan trọng trong TOEIC?\n\nReporting verbs thường xuất hiện trong:\n\n- Email\n- Báo cáo\n- Thông báo\n- Tin tức doanh nghiệp\n- Part 5\n- Part 6\n- Part 7\n\n## 4. Mẹo\n\nKhông học reporting verb riêng lẻ.\n\nHãy học cả **cấu trúc đi sau động từ**.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nsay + that clause\n\ntell + object + that clause\n\nadvise + object + to V\n\nsuggest + V-ing\n\n	1	2026-08-08 20:22:47.186707	2026-08-08 20:22:47.186707	\N
