585	50	Reporting Verb + Object + To V	\n\n# Reporting Verb + Object + To V\n\n## 1. Một số động từ\n\nMột số reporting verbs có cấu trúc:\n\n**verb + object + to V**\n\nCác động từ thường gặp:\n\n- advise\n- ask\n- tell\n- remind\n- encourage\n- invite\n- warn\n- persuade\n- urge\n\n## 2. Ví dụ\n\nThe manager advised employees to attend the training.\n\nShe told me to submit the report.\n\nThe manager reminded us to check the documents.\n\nThe company encouraged employees to participate.\n\n## 3. PERSUADE\n\nPersuade = thuyết phục.\n\nCấu trúc:\n\n**persuade + someone + to V**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe manager persuaded the client to accept the proposal.\n\n## 4. URGE\n\nUrge = thúc giục.\n\nCấu trúc:\n\n**urge + someone + to V**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nThe company urged customers to contact support.\n\n## 5. Mẹo\n\nNếu reporting verb có:\n\n**someone + to V**\n\nhãy kiểm tra:\n\nadvise\n\ntell\n\nremind\n\nencourage\n\npersuade\n\nurge\n\n	9	2026-08-08 20:22:47.186707	2026-08-08 20:22:47.186707	\N
