822	74	According to, Regarding và Concerning	\n\n# According to, Regarding và Concerning\n\n## 1. According to\n\nAccording to = theo như.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nAccording to the report, sales increased last month.\n\nAccording to company policy, employees must wear identification badges.\n\n## 2. Regarding\n\nRegarding = về / liên quan đến.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nRegarding your application, we need additional information.\n\n## 3. Concerning\n\nConcerning có nghĩa gần với regarding.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nPlease contact us concerning your reservation.\n\n## 4. Cấu trúc\n\nCác từ này thường đứng trước:\n\n**noun / noun phrase**\n\nVí dụ:\n\nregarding the new policy\n\nconcerning the contract\n\naccording to the report\n\n## 5. TOEIC\n\n______ company policy, employees must submit the form by Friday.\n\nA. According to\nB. Because\nC. Despite\nD. Unless\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. According to**\n\n## 6. Mẹo\n\nHọc các cụm này như một đơn vị:\n\n**according to + noun**\n\n**regarding + noun**\n\n**concerning + noun**\n\n	6	2026-08-08 20:36:30.219148	2026-08-08 20:36:30.219148	\N
