843	76	Unless, Provided That và As Long As	\n\n# Unless, Provided That và As Long As\n\n## 1. Unless\n\nUnless = if...not.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nUnless you submit the form, your application will not be processed.\n\n## 2. Provided That\n\nProvided that = với điều kiện là.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nEmployees can work remotely provided that they meet the requirements.\n\n## 3. As Long As\n\nAs long as = miễn là.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nYou can use the equipment as long as you follow the safety rules.\n\n## 4. So sánh\n\n### Unless\n\nĐiều kiện phủ định.\n\nUnless you hurry, you will miss the train.\n\n### Provided that\n\nNhấn mạnh điều kiện bắt buộc.\n\nYou can enter provided that you have an ID.\n\n### As long as\n\nNhấn mạnh điều kiện cần được duy trì.\n\nYou can stay as long as you follow the rules.\n\n## 5. Mẹo\n\nKhông dùng:\n\nunless + not\n\nSai:\n\nUnless you don't submit the form...\n\nĐúng:\n\nUnless you submit the form...\n\n	7	2026-08-08 20:38:11.69628	2026-08-08 20:38:11.69628	\N
844	76	Even If và In Case	\n\n# Even If và In Case\n\n## 1. Even If\n\nEven if = ngay cả khi / dù cho.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nEven if demand decreases, the company will continue production.\n\n→ Điều kiện có thể xảy ra nhưng kết quả vẫn giữ nguyên.\n\n## 2. In Case\n\nIn case = phòng khi.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nTake an umbrella in case it rains.\n\n→ Chuẩn bị trước cho khả năng có thể xảy ra.\n\n## 3. So sánh\n\n### Even if\n\nTập trung vào kết quả không thay đổi.\n\nEven if it rains, we will continue the event.\n\n### In case\n\nTập trung vào việc chuẩn bị.\n\nTake an umbrella in case it rains.\n\n## 4. TOEIC\n\nThe company hired temporary workers ______ demand increases unexpectedly.\n\nA. even if\nB. in case\nC. unless\nD. although\n\nNếu ý là "phòng khi nhu cầu tăng":\n\n**B. in case**\n\n## 5. Mẹo\n\n**even if → dù điều kiện xảy ra**\n\n**in case → chuẩn bị phòng khi xảy ra**\n\n	8	2026-08-08 20:38:11.69628	2026-08-08 20:38:11.69628	\N
845	76	Conditional Inversion	\n\n# Conditional Inversion\n\n## 1. Khái niệm\n\nTrong văn phong trang trọng, có thể đảo cấu trúc câu điều kiện bằng cách bỏ **if**.\n\n## 2. Had\n\nIf I had known, I would have helped.\n\n→ **Had I known, I would have helped.**\n\n## 3. Were\n\nIf I were you, I would accept the offer.\n\n→ **Were I you, I would accept the offer.**\n\n## 4. Should\n\nIf you need assistance, please contact us.\n\n→ **Should you need assistance, please contact us.**\n\n## 5. Cấu trúc\n\n### Had\n\n**Had + S + V3, ...**\n\n### Were\n\n**Were + S + ...**\n\n### Should\n\n**Should + S + V, ...**\n\n## 6. TOEIC\n\n______ you require additional information, please contact our office.\n\nA. Should\nB. Had\nC. Were\nD. Unless\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. Should**\n\n→ Should you require additional information...\n\n## 7. Mẹo\n\nNếu thấy:\n\n**Had / Were / Should + subject**\n\nhãy kiểm tra khả năng đó là **conditional inversion**.\n\n	9	2026-08-08 20:38:11.69628	2026-08-08 20:38:11.69628	\N
846	76	Bẫy Advanced Conditionals trong TOEIC	\n\n# Bẫy Advanced Conditionals trong TOEIC\n\n## 1. Zero Conditional\n\nIf the machine overheats, it ______ automatically.\n\nA. shut down\nB. shuts down\nC. will shut down\nD. would shut down\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. shuts down**\n\n→ sự thật/quy luật.\n\n---\n\n## 2. First Conditional\n\nIf the shipment arrives today, we ______ it immediately.\n\nA. process\nB. processed\nC. will process\nD. would process\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. will process**\n\n---\n\n## 3. Second Conditional\n\nIf the company had more employees, it ______ more projects.\n\nA. accepts\nB. accepted\nC. would accept\nD. will accept\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. would accept**\n\n---\n\n## 4. Third Conditional\n\nIf the manager had approved the proposal, we ______ the project.\n\nA. would start\nB. will start\nC. would have started\nD. started\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. would have started**\n\n---\n\n## 5. Mixed Conditional\n\nIf the company had invested earlier, it ______ more competitive now.\n\nA. is\nB. would be\nC. would have been\nD. will be\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. would be**\n\n---\n\n## 6. Unless\n\nUnless the payment is received, the order ______ shipped.\n\nA. will not be\nB. would not be\nC. had not been\nD. was not\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. will not be**\n\n---\n\n## 7. Provided That\n\nEmployees may work remotely ______ they follow company policy.\n\nA. provided that\nB. although\nC. despite\nD. because of\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. provided that**\n\n---\n\n## 8. In Case\n\nTake a copy of the document ______ the original is lost.\n\nA. even if\nB. in case\nC. unless\nD. although\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. in case**\n\n---\n\n## 9. Conditional Inversion\n\n______ you require assistance, please contact the help desk.\n\nA. Should\nB. Had\nC. Were\nD. Unless\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. Should**\n\n→ Should you require assistance...\n\n---\n\n## 10. Chiến thuật tổng hợp\n\nKhi gặp câu điều kiện:\n\n### Bước 1\n\nXác định thời gian.\n\n**Hiện tại / tương lai**\n\n→ First hoặc Second.\n\n**Quá khứ**\n\n→ Third.\n\n### Bước 2\n\nXác định tính thực tế.\n\n**Có khả năng xảy ra**\n\n→ First Conditional.\n\n**Giả định / không thực tế**\n\n→ Second Conditional.\n\n**Đã không xảy ra trong quá khứ**\n\n→ Third Conditional.\n\n### Bước 3\n\nKiểm tra kết quả.\n\n**would + V**\n\n→ giả định hiện tại.\n\n**would have + V3**\n\n→ giả định quá khứ.\n\n### Bước 4\n\nKiểm tra các từ đặc biệt:\n\n- unless\n- provided that\n- as long as\n- even if\n- in case\n- should\n- had\n- were\n\n## Công thức tổng hợp\n\n**Zero:**\n\nIf + present, present\n\n**First:**\n\nIf + present, will + V\n\n**Second:**\n\nIf + past, would + V\n\n**Third:**\n\nIf + had + V3, would have + V3\n\n**Mixed:**\n\nIf + had + V3, would + V\n\n## Mẹo TOEIC\n\nĐừng chỉ nhìn thấy **if** rồi chọn đáp án có will.\n\nHãy xác định **thời gian + mức độ thực tế + loại conditional** trước.\n\n	10	2026-08-08 20:38:11.69628	2026-08-08 20:38:11.69628	\N
