866	78	Bẫy Advanced Reported Speech trong TOEIC	\n\n# Bẫy Advanced Reported Speech trong TOEIC\n\n## 1. Say và Tell\n\nThe manager ______ us that the meeting was canceled.\n\nA. said\nB. told\nC. spoke\nD. talked\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. told**\n\n---\n\n## 2. Backshift\n\nShe said that she ______ the report the previous day.\n\nA. completes\nB. completed\nC. had completed\nD. has completed\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. had completed**\n\n---\n\n## 3. Reported Question\n\nHe asked where the meeting ______.\n\nA. is\nB. was\nC. did\nD. be\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. was**\n\n---\n\n## 4. Yes/No Question\n\nThe customer asked ______ the order had been shipped.\n\nA. if\nB. what\nC. where\nD. why\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. if**\n\n---\n\n## 5. Reported Command\n\nThe manager told employees ______ the safety rules.\n\nA. follow\nB. following\nC. to follow\nD. followed\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. to follow**\n\n---\n\n## 6. Negative Command\n\nThe supervisor told us ______ the equipment without permission.\n\nA. not to use\nB. don't use\nC. not use\nD. didn't use\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. not to use**\n\n---\n\n## 7. Suggest\n\nThe manager suggested ______ the meeting.\n\nA. postpone\nB. to postpone\nC. postponing\nD. postponed\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. postponing**\n\n---\n\n## 8. Advise\n\nThe consultant advised employees ______ their passwords regularly.\n\nA. change\nB. changing\nC. to change\nD. changed\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**C. to change**\n\n---\n\n## 9. Modal\n\nShe said that she ______ attend the meeting the following day.\n\nA. will\nB. would\nC. can\nD. may\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**B. would**\n\n---\n\n## 10. Chiến thuật tổng hợp\n\nKhi gặp Reported Speech:\n\n### Bước 1\n\nXác định reporting verb:\n\n- say\n- tell\n- ask\n- advise\n- remind\n- suggest\n- recommend\n- warn\n\n### Bước 2\n\nXác định loại câu:\n\n- statement\n- question\n- command\n- request\n- suggestion\n\n### Bước 3\n\nKiểm tra cấu trúc.\n\n**say + clause**\n\n**tell + someone + clause**\n\n**ask + if/whether + clause**\n\n**ask + wh-word + clause**\n\n**tell/ask + object + to V**\n\n**suggest + V-ing**\n\n**advise + object + to V**\n\n### Bước 4\n\nNếu reporting verb ở quá khứ, kiểm tra backshift.\n\n### Bước 5\n\nKiểm tra đại từ và trạng từ thời gian.\n\n## Công thức nhớ\n\n**Statement:**\n\nsay/tell + that + clause\n\n**Yes/No Question:**\n\nask + if/whether + clause\n\n**Wh-Question:**\n\nask + wh-word + clause\n\n**Command:**\n\ntell + object + to V\n\n**Negative Command:**\n\ntell + object + not to V\n\n**Request:**\n\nask + object + to V\n\n**Suggestion:**\n\nsuggest + V-ing\n\n## Mẹo TOEIC\n\nVới Reported Question, nhớ rằng sau **ask + wh-word / if / whether** phải dùng **trật tự câu khẳng định**, không dùng đảo ngữ.\n\nVí dụ:\n\nĐúng:\n\nHe asked where the manager **was**.\n\nSai:\n\nHe asked where **was the manager**.\n\n	10	2026-08-08 20:39:04.351223	2026-08-08 20:39:04.351223	\N
