954	83	Comparison và Parallel Structure Traps	\n\n# Comparison và Parallelism Traps\n\n## 1. Comparative\n\nThe new model is **more efficient than** the old one.\n\n## 2. Superlative\n\nThis is **the most efficient** model.\n\n## 3. As...as\n\nThe new system is **as reliable as** the old one.\n\n## 4. Fewer vs Less\n\n### Fewer\n\nDanh từ đếm được.\n\nfewer employees\n\nfewer problems\n\n### Less\n\nDanh từ không đếm được.\n\nless time\n\nless money\n\n## 5. Parallel Structure\n\nSai:\n\nThe position requires **planning, organizing, and to communicate**.\n\nĐúng:\n\nThe position requires **planning, organizing, and communicating**.\n\n## 6. So sánh phải cùng loại\n\nSai:\n\nThe salary of the manager is higher than **an employee**.\n\nĐúng:\n\nThe salary of the manager is higher than **that of an employee**.\n\n## 7. TOEIC\n\nThe new system is more efficient than ______.\n\nA. the old system\nB. the old\nC. the employees\nD. efficiently\n\nĐáp án:\n\n**A. the old system**\n\n	8	2026-08-08 20:51:56.319899	2026-08-08 20:51:56.319899	\N
